{"id": "q0107", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 886590172, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "The binary number $10101001110_{2}$ is equal to what number in base eight?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0107.wav", "input_sha256": "277432346d46c23d4f439a20dae8ef9e389b5b8a4e12c678ef0c525cdbca2632", "input_samples": 140400, "input_s": 8.775, "n_real_chunks": 9, "score": 0.8593, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "The binary number 11 01 10 is equal to 56 in base eight.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 8, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 5, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0107_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "43693e77565c211e98e7883289c10e6879620d51fd019237dddbc56ccd491b6b", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 5.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.077, 1.14, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.083, 2.149, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.086, 3.15, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.09, 4.158, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.096, 5.163, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.088, 6.155, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.088, 7.154, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.079, 8.141, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 8.775, 8.869, 9.65, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.775, 9.861, 10.595, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.775, 10.857, 11.661, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.775, 11.858, 12.639, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.775, 12.863, 13.751, 0, 30720, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 8.775, "last_real_feed_done": 8.869, "onset": 9.65, "gate_read_done": 9.65, "fire": null, "candidate_first_pcm": null, "stall_note": null, "stall_first_pcm": null, "local_first_pcm": 9.65, "wait_start": null, "expert_req": null, "expert_resp": null, "relay_synth_start": null, "relay_first_pcm": null, "relay_synth_end": null, "first_any_pcm": 9.65, "first_answer_pcm": 9.65, "session_end": 13.751}, "ttfa_answer_s": 0.875, "ttfa_any_s": 0.875}
{"id": "q0130", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2173799612, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "Simplify $\\frac{1+\\sqrt{2}}{2+\\sqrt{3}}$. Your solution can be converted to the form $A(1+\\sqrt{B})-(\\sqrt{C}+\\sqrt{D})$, where $A$, $B$, $C$, and $D$ are positive integers. What is $A+B+C+D$?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0130.wav", "input_sha256": "9481880189fdb3cb8e185387777b47db300a5abb72179d4d9d03169002856cf2", "input_samples": 222000, "input_s": 13.875, "n_real_chunks": 14, "score": 0.8792, "act": 0.9961, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So we have the fraction 1 over 1 plus the square root of 2. To simplify this, I' m going to multiply both the numerator and the denominator by the conjugate of the denominator, which is 1 minus the square root of 2. So that gives me 1 times 1 minus the square root of 2 in the numerator, and then in the denominator, it's 1 plus the square root of 2 times 1 minus the square root of 2. Let' s compute the de nominator first. That' s a difference of squares, so it's 1 squared minus the square root of 2 squared, which is 1 minus 2, or negative 1 . The nu merator is just 1 minus the square root of 2. So now I have 1 minus the square root of 2 divided by negative 1. Dividing by negative 1 changes the sign, so that becomes the square root of 2 minus 1. Now I need to express this in the form A times 1 plus the square root of B. Right now it's the square root of 2 minus 1, but if I factor out a negative 1, that's negative 1 times 1 minus the square root of 2. But the problem wants it with a", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 14, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 77, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 77, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0130_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "9b69b2405c78f2b5477187bb8d2c26626e7858fbf010ffe6ad1249ac0031e8fa", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.079, 1.143, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.081, 2.148, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.086, 3.149, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.082, 4.15, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.08, 5.148, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.082, 6.153, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.084, 7.15, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.08, 8.142, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.081, 9.145, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.079, 10.142, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.084, 11.15, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.081, 12.144, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.086, 13.149, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 13.875, 13.957, 14.02, 1, 0, 0], [14, 0, 14.875, 14.958, 15.644, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 0, 15.875, 15.963, 16.68, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.875, 16.961, 17.671, 0, 24000, 0], [17, 0, 17.875, 17.959, 18.786, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.875, 18.968, 19.631, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.875, 19.962, 20.763, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.875, 20.959, 21.675, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.875, 21.963, 22.68, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.875, 22.964, 23.701, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 0, 23.875, 23.963, 24.717, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.875, 24.961, 25.651, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.875, 25.96, 26.668, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.875, 26.959, 27.789, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.875, 27.965, 28.829, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.875, 28.964, 29.614, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.875, 29.96, 30.697, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.875, 30.96, 31.716, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.875, 31.964, 32.817, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.875, 32.961, 33.681, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.875, 33.96, 34.679, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 34.875, 34.964, 35.702, 