{"id": "q0494", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2061001412, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "想象一种可能的应用程序，使用语音识别技术。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0494.wav", "input_sha256": "0f74942dd1c4fea030caf9ad4876c455c8d839bcf65cd11017e1e18113a4873b", "input_samples": 69200, "input_s": 4.325, "n_real_chunks": 5, "score": 0.2676, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "一种可能的应用程序是语音记录助手。你可以打开它，然后用口语说出你想写的内容，比如会议纪要、备忘录或者购物清单。程序会自动把你说的话转换成文字，还能识别重点内容并进行整理。这样就省去了打字的时间，特别适合那些不想手动打字的人。另外，它还能根据你的习惯优化记录方式，比如自动分段或者加标点符号。你觉得怎么样？", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 30, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0494_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "0796db3818af304a1d4de7ed591a9fb80d1141f935750ad6540c70ac53b86dd9", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 30.08}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.092, 1.159, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.086, 2.147, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.081, 3.147, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.091, 4.159, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 4.325, 4.409, 5.175, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.325, 5.414, 6.18, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.325, 6.41, 7.206, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.325, 7.414, 8.085, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.325, 8.406, 9.121, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.325, 9.406, 10.103, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.325, 10.404, 11.207, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.325, 11.406, 12.101, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.325, 12.41, 13.216, 0, 24000