{"id": "q0535", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 4143108335, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "解释假设为什么有效：顾客支出的增加将增加公司利润。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0535.wav", "input_sha256": "e771cace65cc3e6483b9b58403e75af61fa73920f340e0722153e74696d65836", "input_samples": 80200, "input_s": 5.013, "n_real_chunks": 6, "score": 0.4658, "act": 0.999, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "这个假设是有效的，因为当顾客支出增加时，公司的收入就会随之增长。如果成本保持不变或增长速度慢于收入，那么利润自然就会增加。当然，这个结论有前提，比如公司没有遇到额外的开支压力。但总体来说，假设是有道理的。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 5, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 24, "feed_lag_max_ms": 132, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 132, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0535_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "24881a76d1fb362d1a5f9f6ab4cd8bc97c8f234df1563e6160938e8df6e40ae0", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 22.64}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.076, 1.135, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.079, 2.141, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.079, 3.141, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.081, 4.146, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.08, 5.145, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 5.013, 5.221, 5.444, 0, 0, 0], [6, 0, 6.013, 6.094, 6.81, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.013, 7.094, 7.802, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.012, 8.095, 8.751, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.012, 9.098, 9.878, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.012, 10.096, 10.831, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.012, 11.097, 11.814, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.012, 12.095, 12.754, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.012, 13.096, 13.803, 0, 24000, 0], [